{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":499057,"name":"Andrew","username":"AndrewC","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/andrewc/{size}/111447_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T12:30:56.767Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eAs I see cursor natural evolution is to Grok bot - this is some of my initial feedback:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot usage should be brought into normal Cursor models usage - as grok Bot usage on Ultra is too little.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/7/f7d3aa3329a110d35ebff0e5600bb7722a03eb28.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zmnqlPY5DXHdN92hMWZ27c2nr4s\" width=\"690\" height=\"68\" data-dominant-color=\"211718\"\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDeeper cursor cloud integration - SSH keys, Secrets, Environments\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat last point is desperately needed. There appears to be some integration but its not clear:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/c/8/c83c1f11003a3bf488cdce7ba26be7504a247d56.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/szmiODkBU6IRcuZTIjG2ZEUVyR0.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/c/8/c83c1f11003a3bf488cdce7ba26be7504a247d56.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"szmiODkBU6IRcuZTIjG2ZEUVyR0\" width=\"496\" height=\"299\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e496×299 10.2 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\